=== 4. ... but it is still a standby, so writes fail
$ psql -X -p 5435 -d ead -c "SELECT pg_is_in_recovery() AS still_standby;"
 still_standby 
---------------
 t
(1 row)


$ psql -X -p 5435 -d ead -c "UPDATE ead.finding SET status = 'in_progress' WHERE finding_id = (SELECT min(finding_id) FROM ead.finding WHERE status = 'open');"
ERROR:  cannot execute UPDATE in a read-only transaction

=== 5. Promote Port Harcourt (manual failover)
$ psql -X -p 5435 -d ead -c "SELECT pg_promote(wait => true, wait_seconds => 30) AS promoted;"
 promoted 
----------
 t
(1 row)


Promotion took 0.13 seconds

$ psql -X -p 5435 -d ead -c "SELECT pg_is_in_recovery() AS still_standby;"
 still_standby 
---------------
 f
(1 row)


